uploadfolder-command-description = 將您「UserData」資料夾中的資料夾（含子資料夾）遞迴上傳至伺服器的 contentDB。
uploadfolder-command-help = 上傳資料夾 [您要上傳至 userdata/UploadFolder 中的資料夾]
uploadfolder-command-wrong-args = 參數個數不對！
uploadfolder-command-folder-not-found = 找不到資料夾 { $folder }！
uploadfolder-command-resource-upload-disabled = 目前已停用網路資源上傳功能。請檢查伺服器 CVars。
uploadfolder-command-file-too-big = 檔案 { $filename } 超過當前大小限制！其大小必須小於 { $sizeLimit } MB。跳過。
uploadfolder-command-success = 已上傳 { $fileCount } 個檔案
